      For those of yas that would like to get
      some training and group with some Hessians this weekend we're lookin at
      Befallen for some hunting.<br>
      <br>
      Best levels are from the low to high teens.<br>
      <br>
      See yas that can be there...<br>
      <br>
      Cruwella, our inkie warrior, has said she will be there willing to fight
