      <p align="center"><a href="http://pub49.ezboard.com/fthehessiansofmorellthulefrm9.showMessage?topicID=11.topic"><font size="2" color="#FFFFFF"><b>Clearing
      the Sister Isle</b></font></a><font color="#FFFFFF" size="4"><br><font size="2">I wish to confirm a contract for the
      Hessians to purge the Island of the Sisterhood of Erollisi. I will pay
      1000pp if the Island is cleared of the Sisters (including those in the
      village) and kept that way for an hour.<br>
      <br>
      I will also pay a bounty of 1pp for every chunk of wood elven flesh ripped
      from those aggravating
      </font>
      </font><font size="2" color="#FFFFFF">pure hearts</font><font color="#FFFFFF" size="4"><font size="2">
      and presented to me in that time.<br>
      <br>
      Full looting and pillage rights will be granted to the Hessians that
      participate, and I would advise that most of you do so. The Sisters are a
      martial order, and could prove challenging foes to a small force.<br>
      <br>
      Full payment will be VOIDED if I am forced to flee the island or are
      incapacitated, though I will pay a portion of the contract in relation to
      how long I was able to enjoy the slaughter.<br>
      <br>
      The raid will be this Saturday, from 4pm to 5pm EST. I trust I will not
      have to wait long for your reply, and look forward to the festivities.<br>
      <br>
      Vexxra K'Synn<br>
