      <p align="center">
      <font size="2">
      <b><a href="http://pub49.ezboard.com/fthehessiansofmorellthulefrm9.showMessage?topicID=2.topic">Fulfilling the vanity</a></b><br>
      Eisabeau is in need doing something about her wardrobe. She is still
      wearing a raw-hide collor and banded bracers and a banded mantle.<br>
      <br>
      What she would like is a bloodied mantle, and hmm, what else?<br>
      <br>
      As for a weapon, I found something I'd really like to have to slash in the
      face of the evil Hand - an Icetooth Claw. I am busily trying to raise cash
      to pay for this endeavor, for I feel it is a must for my ensemble.<br>
      <br>
      Any takers on any of these items, I shall be about Norrath most eve's this
      week.</font></p>
      <p align="center"><font size="2">Eisabeau Willows<br>
      Draconian Seneschal<hr></font></p>
      <p align="center"><font color="#FFFFFF" size="2"><b>Befallen Contract</b>
      <br>
      </font><font color="#FFFFFF" size="2">We will being goin out for our first
      contract on Saturday, March 3rd. We are to attempt retrieval of the
      Blackened Wand in Befallen. Alot of us are pretty butch now so I don't see
      this as being a very difficult contract to complete...levels of Hessians
      we need are 15 - 23 (if these levels are too low/high please post a
      response lettin us know a better range).<br>
      <br>
      There will be a guild meeting at 4pm CST (2pm PST/ 5pm EST) just outside
      Befallen before the raid. It will be a good time to meet each other
      again...duel...learn languages and trade items.</font><font size="2" color="#FFFFFF"><br><br>
      Anae<br>
      A.K.A. Stinky<br>
      Hessian Commander<hr></font>
  <font size="2">
      </font>
      <p align="center"><font size="2"><b><a href="http://pub49.ezboard.com/fthehessiansofmorellthulefrm9.showMessage?topicID=9.topic">A Little Picnic in Unrest</a></b></font><font color="#FFFFFF">
