      <br>
      This Friday, March 16th, is the day we're shooting for...around 5 p.m. CST
      (3 p.m. PST / 6 p.m. EST). But even after we get the item we may play with
      the nasties in there...I'll be there 'til really late like 2 or 3 a.m.
