      <br>
      Greetings, I have need of a small job in purchasing
      to be done, as I am simply to busy for this journey.<br>
      What I need is a 'Tackle Box and fishing hooks. From what I understand,
      these items can be purchases at the Ocean of Tears, at some shop there.
      The hooks I need are the following;<br>
      Circular, Treble and Dry Hooks<br>
      <br>
      Fill the Tackle box up with an even amount of each. The total cost of this
      is estimated at 3pp. I will pay an even 10pp for what I ask.<br>
      <br>
      Atholl, SK<br>
      House Rea' Morda</font>
